Maddalena/llm-state*/

# --- Visual Studio / utente ---
.vs/
*.user

# --- Test ---
[Tt]est[Rr]esults/

# --- Output di publish.ps1 / aspire publish (compose + .env generati) ---
out/
out-deploy/
